  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Initiates a 2-step ownership transfer to a new address.\\n\\nRequires authorization from the current owner. The new owner must later\\ncall `accept_ownership()` to complete the transfer.\\n\\n# Arguments\\n\\n* `e` - Access to the Soroban environment.\\n* `new_owner` - The proposed new owner.\\n* `live_until_ledger` - Ledger number until which the new owner can\\naccept. A value of `0` cancels any pending transfer.\\n\\n# Errors\\n\\n* [`OwnableError::OwnerNotSet`] - If the owner is not set.\\n* [`crate::role_transfer::RoleTransferError::NoPendingTransfer`] - If\\ntrying to cancel a transfer that doesn't exist.\\n* [`crate::role_transfer::RoleTransferError::InvalidLiveUntilLedger`] -\\nIf the specified ledger is in the past.\\n* [`crate::role_transfer::RoleTransferError::InvalidPendingAccount`] -\\nIf the specified pending account is not the same as the provided `new`\\naddress.\\n\\n# Notes\\n\\n* Authorization for the current owner is required.",
      "name": "transfer_ownership",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_owner",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "live_until_ledger",
          "type_": "u32"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Verify before the pinned SDK parser decodes the authenticated payload,\\nthen store only owner-admitted feeds with fresh, advancing timestamps.\\n\\nA signature or envelope Pyth's verifier refuses returns\\n`VerifierRejected`; unparsable verified bytes return `InvalidPayload`.\\n`VerifierInvokeFailed` means the verifier trapped or answered with a code\\nthis SDK does not know \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the signal that its ABI changed under us.",
      "name": "update_price_feeds",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "payload",
          "type_": "bytes"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "u32",
            "error_type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "LazerSourceError"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
